  storyText: "Celestine\n\nCelestine, the Voodoo Boys' best netrunner, scans the shard. Her eyes widen.\n\n\"This is a piece of something from beyond the Blackwall. We've spent years trying to talk to them. Dive with us. Help us open a gate.\"\n\n1. \"Let's do it.\"\n2. \"What happens to Mirage?\"\n3. \"No.\" Leave."
